<metadata><name>Day 82 - Fairway Meadows</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.247139" lon="-81.615338"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>A small off road parking area</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.246720" lon="-81.615969"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Junction. Turn right to stay on the main Bruce Trail, heading north-west. (the blue-blazed Fairway Meadows Side Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
